{#
  Custom 404 (2026-08-30, "itemi mici" pass). Deliberately does NOT extend
  base.njk / include nav.njk: GitHub Pages serves this exact file's HTML
  for ANY unmatched path, but the browser's address bar keeps showing
  whatever URL was actually requested — which could be arbitrarily deep
  (e.g. /some/old/link). Every other page's relative asset/nav paths
  ("assets/...", "index.html") only work because those pages are always
  served from a URL one level deep at most; on a 404 for a deeper path,
  the same relative paths would resolve against the wrong directory and
  silently 404 a second time (broken logo, unstyled page). So every
  reference here is deliberately absolute, built from site.baseUrl (see
  src/_data/site.js) — the same single source of truth the SEO pass
  already introduced for canonical/OG URLs.
#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Pagina Nu A Fost Găsită | Caloric</title>
<meta name="description" content="Pagina căutată nu există sau a fost mutată. Revino la pagina principală Caloric — instalații HVAC în Brăila.">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">

<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1a2e" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">

<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ site.baseUrl }}/assets/favicon.png">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ site.baseUrl }}/assets/css/site.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-ice-950 dark:text-ice-50 antialiased dark:bg-ice-950 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-5">

  <div class="max-w-md w-full text-center py-16">
    <img src="{{ site.baseUrl }}/assets/logo-caloric.png" alt="Sigla Caloric" class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-6 object-contain">

    <p class="text-6xl sm:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ice-600 dark:text-ice-400">404</p>

    <h1 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-ice-950 dark:text-ice-50">Pagina nu a fost găsită</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ice-900/70 dark:text-ice-100/70 leading-relaxed">
      Linkul accesat nu (mai) există sau a fost mutat. Poți reveni la pagina principală, sau ne poți contacta direct pentru o ofertă.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="{{ site.baseUrl }}/index.html"
         class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-ice-500 hover:bg-ice-400 text-ice-950 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition-colors">
        Înapoi la pagina principală
      </a>
      <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}"
         class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-ice-300 dark:border-ice-700 text-ice-900 dark:text-ice-100 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-ice-50 dark:hover:bg-ice-800 transition-colors">
        Sună-ne: {{ site.phone }}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
